# Generated build and test output.
#
# Everything a verification run writes lands here: the acceptance and browser
# suites' logs, screenshots and fixtures, the synthetic Chromium profile, and
# the local TLS fixtures the URL-importer tests generate. Set `EVIDENCE_DIR` to
# write a run's evidence somewhere else (see `scripts/evidence-dir.mjs`); this
# entry keeps the default location out of version control.
artifacts/

# Written by `apps/reader-release/build.mjs` beside the bundle it describes:
# the file list and content hash of the offline shell it just emitted.
apps/reader-release/build-manifest.json
